<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission forecast for Denmark.</title>
<headline>EU Commission forecast for Denmark.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic</p>
<p>forecasts by the European Commission for Denmark, released on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		3.0	   2.9</p>
<p> Investment			5.8	   5.7</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    2.3	   2.6</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    5.1	   4.7</p>
<p> Public sector surplus	 0.3	   0.3</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  67.2	  64.3</p>
</text>
